	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Browse, open and complete 2Do tasks and lists from Alfred.

Type `ls` to browse your 2Do lists and smart lists.

![2Do lists and smart lists in Alfred](images/about/lists.png)

## Commands

* `ls` - browse lists and smart lists; Enter opens one in 2Do.
* `to` - search all uncompleted tasks as you type; open, complete or delete.
* `today` - tasks due today or overdue; open, complete or delete.
* `ct` - search completed tasks; open, uncomplete or delete.

Each task row shows its list, due date, tags and the start of its notes.

## Requirements

* 2Do for Mac with the 2Do Automation Suite AppleScript dictionary.
